# Research pipeline brief (2026-07-30): per-job override for agent_propose.sh
# (AGENT_JOB_OVERRIDES). Non-secret task wiring only — API keys stay in the canonical
# secrets.env, sourced first.
#
# EXAMPLE ONLY. The live file lives OUTSIDE git at
#   ~/.config/agent-workforce/standing_research.env  (mode 600, owned by dave)
# and is intentionally NOT committed — mirrors m1_signal_scan.env exactly.
# Install: copy the vars below into that path, then chmod 600.
#
# Why this exists: the standing research run was hard-down for ten days
# (2026-07-21..30) on hermes/claudius via OpenRouter, hitting HTTP 402 "Insufficient
# credits" on every attempt — OpenRouter reserves the worst-case cost of max_tokens up
# front, so a nearly spent monthly cap rejects the request before any inference happens.
# The 402 lands in the hermes profile's own errors.log, never in the attempt's stdout, so
# agent_propose.sh's PROVIDER_ERROR_RE scan could not see it and every dead run logged
# "OK: run completed, agent produced no proposal" — eight consecutive NOPROPOSAL runs
# read as a clean decline. agent_propose.sh is runtime-agnostic (it just execs
# AGENT_RUNTIME_CMD), so only these lines change. AGENT_VERIFY_CMD closes the silent-
# failure hole itself: a run that dies produces neither a dated proposal nor a DECLINE
# sentinel, so proposal_or_decline.sh fails it instead of letting it pass as NOPROPOSAL.
AGENT_PROFILE=claude-opus
AGENT_TASK_SLUG=standing-research
# Optional: cap retries so a transient failure doesn't triple-run an expensive Claude
# Code research pass (default is 3).
AGENT_MAX_ATTEMPTS=2
AGENT_RUNTIME_CMD='~/agent-workforce/bin/run_standing_research_cc.sh'
AGENT_VERIFY_CMD='~/agent-workforce/bin/proposal_or_decline.sh standing-research'

# --- Previous runtime (hermes/claudius on OpenRouter via the kanban path).
# NOT A REVERT PATH SINCE 2026-09-02. This block was labelled "kept for easy revert"
# until the S3 retirement (open-decisions.md D7) deleted bin/kanban_run_and_wait.sh.
# Uncommenting it now installs a runner that does not exist: the unit stays green in
# list-timers and is structurally incapable of producing anything, which is the exact
# failure mode D8's drift check was built for. Kept as a record of what ran before
# 2026-07-30, not as an instruction. ---
# AGENT_PROFILE=claudius
# AGENT_TASK_SLUG=standing
# AGENT_RUNTIME_CMD='cd ~/agent-worktrees/inbox && ~/agent-workforce/bin/kanban_run_and_wait.sh "Nightly box-brief run" ~/agent-workforce/profiles/claudius_task.md claudius ~/agent-worktrees/inbox "nightly-research-analyst-$(date -u +%Y-%m-%d)" 20m'
